5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to understand the actual financial scope before we commit. What does the ledger say about this year’s development allocation?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I’m less interested in the money than the results. Did any of our previous initiatives actually change patient outcomes, or just add paperwork?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I’m curious how new programs affect our daily rosters. Which teams would realistically absorb the extra workload without burning out?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried about the physical space. Can we actually fit another program into the rooms and parking without everything seizing up?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about what happens after the ribbon is cut. Where do these new arrangements usually break down in the second year?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I appreciate the focus on outcomes, Shion. But without knowing the financial ceiling, we can't even define what is realistically buildable.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, the ceiling is irrelevant if the floor is broken. We need to know if the previous attempts actually worked before we spend a single coin.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, I hear you, but rosters are where the real strain shows. I need to see the staffing records to know who can actually take on this load.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, that’s true, but if the rooms are already full, adding staff just makes the squeeze worse. I need to check the physical capacity first.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, the rooms are only part of it. I’ve seen programs fail because the people running them never truly agreed to the burden.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, that’s a fair point. But I still need to know the financial ceiling to see if any of these options are even viable.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, you’re still looking at the ceiling. I’m looking at the floor. If the foundation is rotten, the height doesn’t matter.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, I understand your caution, but I need to see the staffing records to understand the real capacity. Which two items should I investigate?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, I’m checking the rooms and parking coverage. If the physical space is already maxed out, adding more staff just makes the squeeze worse.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, I will look into the board minutes and the shared nursing round to see where past arrangements quietly fell apart.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll check the ledger and the regional fund tariffs. I need to know exactly what we can afford and what we can actually bill for.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,I’ll examine the readmission figures and the booking system. I need to know if past efforts actually worked and if they even left a trace.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I’ll look into the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy staffing review. I need to see where the pressure actually sits before we assign more work.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I’ll check the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, plus what the booking system records. I need to see if the physical space and digital slots can handle another program without seizing up.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I’ll look into the board minutes and the shared nursing round. I want to see where past arrangements quietly fell apart.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
